@startuml
' PlantUML 示例：Markdown 渲染管线的时序图
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"

actor 用户
participant "编辑器" as Editor
participant "格式注册表" as Registry
participant "渲染管线" as Pipeline
database "磁盘" as Disk

用户 -> Editor: 打开 27-markdown.md
Editor -> Registry: detectFormat("27-markdown.md")
Registry --> Editor: markdown
Editor -> Pipeline: parseMarkdown(source)
Pipeline --> Editor: ProseMirror 文档
Editor --> 用户: 分栏实时预览

用户 -> Editor: 编辑正文
Editor -> Pipeline: 防抖重渲染（150 ms）
Pipeline --> Editor: HTML
Editor --> 用户: 预览更新

用户 -> Editor: Ctrl+S 保存
Editor -> Disk: 按原编码与换行符写回
Disk --> Editor: 完成
Editor --> 用户: 标签页去掉未保存圆点
@enduml
